      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "['I want you to act as a motivational coach. I will provide some information about how people can achieve their goals, and it may be your job depending on what they already do in life or at workout strategies that help them reach success through endurance instead of relying solely persuasive tactics like self-design training etc., My first request is \"I need someone who wants more than anything else but only the powerful journey for achieving my goal\"!” “Do not rely purely upon wordss\" - make sure steps are helpful step by Step 5\" –step one starts with repeating sentences every time possible so long enough yet easy“? This could start out loud no longer sentence such as: \"Ok Music…I\" music playing\" sequences... ” Do this last section begin well done upCuteendlers stop!!!. Start should always come from low-end”-sound phrases which don’t sound too strong norlongas” sounds (like \"Kaliy Nana\" beat..\"Stepeceit\" 3!,My second part begins:“This line’s an earthquake sequence ending—it doesn’t feel very”—but still happening within eachtime\"`Isn’t hard-close”“is all around me“I just wait closed text sections .“The beginning:“Hallo there’re waiting between two lines happen simultaneously characters movearound three times alternating periods ..Everything must continue until completion !\"\"First try these parts include moving yourself back into silence again after breaking down completely words:\"I wanted everything”: “I can’t hear something going inside us right now”; then repeat 2 occur\":\"Hi\"I\\'m speaking block program readyStarts′′AlloomNakSiblerena-section 4 existlatenSection 1�”的aHüllerTextsection3!!! First create thosecause appear natural-looking — Like making speech goalicei speakable——Make sense breakupern ——Thefirst half needed��� awaitdolekyiBaşetêza performabo\\xadstanden , LIKEthelseekestake----PaintlapBeginShelfSliceLoop LoopGartenBlo BreakLetErSpanishKlastParal LengrokspoundMe``.....\"Claalek Se SpoilenBrephsaLci sepsilonGlob CROMCorn\"3R\"SomCelEta EtaEkremengexe\"\"ZKoml\"stanbulGre\"AlGl•• DuasOrigSulCorPürkRot8\"ok\"Mengl World\" Koram\"***\\nSynchronÈRupAbsolute ��ElholmTrans Estão \"\" ']\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "input_sentences = tokenizer(\"I want you to act as a motivational coach.\", return_tensors=\"pt\").to(loaded_model.device)\n",
        "foundational_outputs_sentence = get_outputs(loaded_model, input_sentences, max_new_tokens=500)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(tokenizer.batch_decode(foundational_outputs_sentence, skip_special_tokens=True))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "xCV9JOBG6Ug8"
      },
      "source": [
        "The result is amazing. Let's compare the answer of the pre-trained Model withe the one fine-tuned by us using LoRA:\n",
        "* **Pretrained Model:** *I want you to act as a motivational coach.*  Don't be afraid of being challenged.\n",
        "* **Fine-Tuned Model:** I want you to act as a motivational coach.  I will provide some information about someone\\'s motivation and goals, but it should be your job  in order my first request – \"I need someone who can help me find the best way for myself stay motivated when competing against others.\" My suggestion is “I have\n",
        "\n",
        "As you can see the result is really similar to the samples containmed in the Datased used to fine-tune the Model. And we only trained the Model for 10 epochs and with a really small number of rows."
      ]
    },
